# Nests Leaf with no package prefix, resolved to *this* package's own msg/ dir - the same
# same-package-sibling case Branch.msg exercises for a .msg-from-.msg nested lookup (see
# fixtures_own/Leaf.msg's own comment), but here the *referencing* file is a .srv, one directory
# level away from msg/Leaf.msg (srv/UsesLeaf.srv vs. msg/Leaf.msg) - the real ROS 2 pkg/{msg,srv}
# layout rcl_interfaces' own SetParameters.srv (nesting msg/Parameter) hits, and the exact shape
# ros2_cli.generate()'s own sibling_dir computation used to get wrong (it looked in this file's own
# srv/ directory instead of msg/, silently falling through to the -I search path instead).
Leaf leaf_value
---
bool ok
